1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,039
A Holy Year doesn't

2
00:00:01,039 --> 00:00:02,796
come every 5 years.

3
00:00:02,796 --> 00:00:04,022
Or every 10.

4
00:00:04,022 --> 00:00:06,242
Here's why it's 2027.

5
00:00:06,242 --> 00:00:07,439
One: it only

6
00:00:07,439 --> 00:00:08,482
happens when July

7
00:00:08,482 --> 00:00:10,449
25 falls on a Sunday.

8
00:00:10,449 --> 00:00:11,717
Two: that's why

9
00:00:11,717 --> 00:00:13,321
it follows an odd rhythm:

10
00:00:13,321 --> 00:00:16,130
every 6, 5, 6 and 11 years.

11
00:00:16,130 --> 00:00:17,386
Three: the last

12
00:00:17,386 --> 00:00:18,247
one lasted two

13
00:00:18,247 --> 00:00:21,125
years, 2021 and 2022,

14
00:00:21,125 --> 00:00:22,814
because of the pandemic.

15
00:00:22,814 --> 00:00:25,143
Four: after 2027,

16
00:00:25,143 --> 00:00:25,839
the next one

17
00:00:25,839 --> 00:00:27,952
isn't until 2032.

18
00:00:27,952 --> 00:00:29,515
Which one surprised you?

19
00:00:29,515 --> 00:00:31,128
Tell me in the comments.
